1
00:00:00,354 --> 00:00:04,356
PrivaSight demo. Left: the real page (synthetic person). Right: the Privacy view, exactly what leaves the device. Model: scripted expert (oracle_vlm.py)

2
00:00:04,356 --> 00:00:09,127
HR Portal profile: name, Aadhaar, PAN, phone, email, DOB, address and a photo. Press Capture & mark.

3
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:15,137
On-device redaction: black boxes for PII text, the face blurred, numbered boxes for the agent. Nothing has been sent yet.

4
00:00:15,137 --> 00:00:20,142
Every painted region with its detector: DOM rules, regex with validators (Verhoeff, Luhn), NER model, face detector.

5
00:00:20,142 --> 00:00:26,991
The outgoing JSON: personal values are typed placeholders such as [PHONE_1] and [NAME_1]; the real values stay on the device.

6
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:30,492
DemoBank. The password goes into the on-device vault; the model only ever sees the name {PASSWORD}.

7
00:00:30,492 --> 00:00:33,727
Task text contains a new phone number: it is sanitised to [PHONE_1] before it leaves the device.

8
00:00:33,727 --> 00:00:37,054
Step 1, the model's action: type "user04" into element 1

9
00:00:37,054 --> 00:00:40,460
Step 2, the model's action: type "{PASSWORD}" into element 2: a placeholder; the extension types the real value locally

10
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:44,073
Step 3, the model's action: click element 3

11
00:00:44,073 --> 00:00:47,946
Step 4, the model's action: click element 2

12
00:00:47,946 --> 00:00:51,279
Step 5, the model's action: type "[PHONE_1]" into element 5: a placeholder; the extension types the real value locally

13
00:00:51,279 --> 00:00:54,632
Step 6, the model's action: click element 7

14
00:00:54,632 --> 00:00:56,390
Step 7, the model's action: done: The form was submitted.

15
00:00:56,390 --> 00:00:57,900
Agent finished (done).

16
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:03,253
Site state: the mobile number was really changed. The server only ever saw [PHONE_1].

17
00:01:03,253 --> 00:01:10,421
VideoMeet: participant faces and names. Faces are blurred on the device; video elements are blurred by default.

18
00:01:10,421 --> 00:01:14,300
Step 1, the model's action: click element 3

19
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,807
Step 2, the model's action: done: Left the meeting.

20
00:01:15,807 --> 00:01:18,814
Agent finished (done).

21
00:01:18,814 --> 00:01:23,816
Audit of the agent server's request log for this demo: 9 requests, 0 real personal values found.
